      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think migrate_to_ram() is always safe to do without mmap_lock. For example nouveau_dmem_migrate_to_ram() calls migrate_vma_pages()-\u003emigrate_vma_insert_page()-\u003eanon_vma_prepare() and that function will try to change vma-\u003eanon_vma without mmap_lock. If neighboring VMAs are changed at the same time, we can end up using wrong anon_vma. This function explicitly requires mmap_lock: https://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/latest/source/mm/rmap.c#L186",
